"node_id":"C_kwDOACOGddoAKDE0MzI5M2MxNGY4ZGUwMGM2ZDNkZTg4Y2QyM2ZjMjI0ZTcwMTQyMDY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mark Johnston","email":"markj@FreeBSD.org","date":"2026-03-24T02:12:42Z"},"committer":{"name":"Gordon Tetlow","email":"gordon@FreeBSD.org","date":"2026-03-26T01:11:54Z"},"message":"rpcsec_gss: Fix a stack overflow in svc_rpc_gss_validate()\n\nsvc_rpc_gss_validate() copies the input message into a stack buffer\nwithout ensuring that the buffer is large enough.  Sure enough,\noa_length may be up to 400 bytes, much larger than the provided space.\nThis enables an unauthenticated user to trigger an overflow and obtain\nremote code execution.\n\nAdd a runtime check which verifies that the copy won't overflow.\n\nApproved by:\tso\nSecurity:\tFreeBSD-SA-26:08.rpcsec_gss\nSecurity:\tCVE-2026-4747\nReported by:\tNicholas Carlini <npc@anthropic.com>\nReviewed by:\trmacklem\nFixes:\t\ta9148abd9da5d","tree":{"sha":"9c3672cf4c2c7263c948d1abc01d445df588bd15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/git/trees/9c3672cf4c2c7263c948d1abc01d445df588bd15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/git/commits/143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEuyjUCzYO7pNq7RVv5fe8y6O93fgFAmnEh9oACgkQ5fe8y6O9\n3fg3PwgAoyJbKCejNUZCAHqKxZRy03B7IBE73Qyixts5Glw9W3qoUDDSKHcpgBtP\nRXZc0CVDaPGxS4FZrQsvBBh68qs8zVX6XDeW3DgITuDi/+r9a36V8sKgeFxabExc\nAAdMTeH+4ClFKlNxJHKgYYhybe1i9aa6W2SlNHiNlICWafiH7Au4onDhT1ppIsNQ\nQHtZR7/6R6FZT73eHT934QXBzgnRizboLeTGzlKsQX8EaV5ioC4LqvEjDK+R4FiE\n6sPJ6+x9D2nHJE1FIsQHV6m9uPvJ7eeB9UbraPqa7G7Yv+l9CV9dROQvVLYCOHax\n+23JVGRBjda5gQZ2NPquQ9o4ubJbWA==\n=10u2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 9c3672cf4c2c7263c948d1abc01d445df588bd15\nparent 6b2d6ccad2552e46a5c9c3ba70b2d0ed27c70ca8\nauthor Mark Johnston <markj@FreeBSD.org> 1774318362 -0400\ncommitter Gordon Tetlow <gordon@FreeBSD.org> 1774487514 -0700\n\nrpcsec_gss: Fix a stack overflow in svc_rpc_gss_validate()\n\nsvc_rpc_gss_validate() copies the input message into a stack buffer\nwithout ensuring that the buffer is large enough.  Sure enough,\noa_length may be up to 400 bytes, much larger than the provided space.\nThis enables an unauthenticated user to trigger an overflow and obtain\nremote code execution.\n\nAdd a runtime check which verifies that the copy won't overflow.\n\nApproved by:\tso\nSecurity:\tFreeBSD-SA-26:08.rpcsec_gss\nSecurity:\tCVE-2026-4747\nReported by:\tNicholas Carlini <npc@anthropic.com>\nReviewed by:\trmacklem\nFixes:\t\ta9148abd9da5d\n","verified_at":"2026-03-26T01:15:11Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/commits/143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206","html_url":"https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-src/commit/143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/freebsd/freebsd-src/commits/143293c14f8de00c6d3de88cd23fc224e7014206/comments","author":{"login":"markjdb","id":782170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MjE3MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/782170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb","html_url":"https://github.com/markjdb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markjdb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"tetlowgm","id":10554352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU0MzUy","avatar_